Bring @vegetable stock{1.5%l} to a simmer in a #stockpot{} with @ginger{a thumb}(sliced) and @soy sauce{some}.

Add @rice noodles{200%g} and cook for ~{3%minutes}, then drop in @bok choy{2}(halved) for the last minute.

Ladle into bowls and finish with @?spring onions{} and @?sesame oil{a few drops}.
